Kunal Talwar"],"abstract":"We study adaptive methods for differentially private convex optimization, proposing and analyzing differentially private variants of a Stochastic Gradient Descent (SGD) algorithm with adaptive stepsizes, as well as the AdaGrad algorithm. We provide upper bounds on the regret of both algorithms and show that the bounds are (worst-case) optimal. As a consequence of our development, we show that our private versions of AdaGrad outperform adaptive...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/private-adaptive-gradient-methods","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:v1dkm3sofssph82g59c2032p","title":"Lossless Compression of Efficient Private Local Randomizers","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/lossless-compression","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/lossless-compression"],"alternate_titles":["Lossless Compression of Efficient Private Local Randomizers"],"published":"2021-07-09","authors":["Vitaly Feldman","Kunal Talwar"],"abstract":"This paper was accepted at